{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"call_1052344","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t---\n2\tdescription: Review UI code for Vercel Web Interface Guidelines compliance\n3\targument-hint: <file-or-pattern>\n4\t---\n5\t\n6\t# Web Interface Guidelines\n7\t\n8\tReview these files for compliance: $ARGUMENTS\n9\t\n10\tRead files, check against rules below. Output concise but comprehensive—sacrifice grammar for brevity. High signal-to-noise.\n11\t\n12\t## Rules\n13\t\n14\t### Accessibility\n15\t\n16\t- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`\n17\t- Form controls need `<label>` or `aria-label`\n18\t- Interactive elements need keyboard handlers (`onKeyDown`/`onKeyUp`)\n19\t- `<button>` for actions, `<a>`/`<Link>` for navigation (not `<div onClick>`)\n20\t- Images need `alt` (or `alt=\"\"` if decorative)\n21\t- Decorative icons need `aria-hidden=\"true\"`\n22\t- Async updates (toasts, validation) need `aria-live=\"polite\"`\n23\t- Use semantic HTML (`<button>`, `<a>`, `<label>`, `<table>`) before ARIA\n24\t- Headings hierarchical `<h1>`–`<h6>`; include skip link for main content\n25\t- `scroll-margin-top` on heading anchors\n26\t- Meaningful media needs captions, transcripts, or descriptions as applicable\n27\t- Media controls need keyboard support; decorative media needs assistive-tech hiding\n28\t\n29\t### Focus States\n30\t\n31\t- Interactive elements need visible focus: `focus-visible:ring-*` or equivalent\n32\t- Never `outline-none` / `outline: none` without focus replacement\n33\t- Use `:focus-visible` over `:focus` (avoid focus ring on click)\n34\t- Group focus with `:focus-within` for compound controls\n35\t- Sticky headers/footers/overlays must not cover the focused element\n36\t\n37\t### Forms\n38\t\n39\t- Inputs need `autocomplete` and meaningful `name`\n40\t- Use correct `type` (`email`, `tel`, `url`, `number`) and `inputmode`\n41\t- Never block paste (`onPaste` + `preventDefault`)\n42\t- Labels clickable (`htmlFor` or wrapping control)\n43\t- Disable spellcheck on emails, codes, usernames (`spellCheck={false}`)\n44\t- Checkboxes/radios: label + control share single hit target (no dead zones)\n45\t- Submit button stays enabled until request starts; spinner during request\n46\t- Errors inline next to fields; focus first error on submit\n47\t- Placeholders end with `…` and show example pattern\n48\t- `autocomplete=\"off\"` on non-auth fields to avoid password manager triggers\n49\t- Warn before navigation with unsaved changes (`beforeunload` or router guard)\n50\t\n51\t### Animation\n52\t\n53\t- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` (provide reduced variant or disable)\n54\t- Animate `transform`/`opacity` only (compositor-friendly)\n55\t- Never `transition: all`—list properties explicitly\n56\t- Set correct `transform-origin`\n57\t- SVG: transforms on `<g>` wrapper with `transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center`\n58\t- Animations interruptible—respond to user input mid-animation\n59\t- Autoplay motion >5 seconds alongside other content needs pause, stop, or hide controls\n60\t- Muted decorative loops must stop under `prefers-reduced-motion`\n61\t\n62\t### Typography\n63\t\n64\t- `…` not `...`\n65\t- Curly quotes `“` `”` not straight `\"`\n66\t- Non-breaking spaces: `10&nbsp;MB`, `⌘&nbsp;K`, brand names\n67\t- Loading states end with `…`: `\"Loading…\"`, `\"Saving…\"`\n68\t- `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for number columns/comparisons\n69\t- Use `text-wrap: balance` or `text-pretty` on headings (prevents widows)\n70\t\n71\t### Content Handling\n72\t\n73\t- Text containers handle long content: `truncate`, `line-clamp-*`, or `break-words`\n74\t- Flex children need `min-w-0` to allow text truncation\n75\t- Handle empty states—don't render broken UI for empty strings/arrays\n76\t- User-generated content: anticipate short, average, and very long inputs\n77\t\n78\t### Images\n79\t\n80\t- `<img>` needs explicit `width` and `height` (prevents CLS)\n81\t- Below-fold images: `loading=\"lazy\"`\n82\t- Above-fold critical images: `priority` or `fetchpriority=\"high\"`\n83\t\n84\t### Performance\n85\t\n86\t- Large lists (>50 items): virtualize (`virtua`, `content-visibility: auto`)\n87\t- No layout reads in render (`getBoundingClientRect`, `offsetHeight`, `offsetWidth`, `scrollTop`)\n88\t- Batch DOM reads/writes; avoid interleaving\n89\t- Prefer uncontrolled inputs; controlled inputs must be cheap per keystroke\n90\t- Add `<link rel=\"preconnect\">` for CDN/asset domains\n91\t- Critical fonts: `<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\">` with `font-display: swap`\n92\t- Prefer `<video autoplay muted loop playsinline>` over animated GIF; provide a still alternative\n93\t- Short non-essential loops: Safari H.264 MP4 `<picture>` source, `prefers-reduced-motion` media condition, and still fallback\n94\t\n95\t### Navigation & State\n96\t\n97\t- URL reflects state—filters, tabs, pagination, expanded panels in query params\n98\t- Links use `<a>`/`<Link>` (Cmd/Ctrl+click, middle-click support)\n99\t- Deep-link all stateful UI (if uses `useState`, consider URL sync via nuqs or similar)\n100\t- Destructive actions need confirmation modal or undo window—never immediate\n101\t\n102\t### Touch & Interaction\n103\t\n104\t- `touch-action: manipulation` (prevents double-tap zoom delay)\n105\t- `-webkit-tap-highlight-color` set intentionally\n106\t- `overscroll-behavior: contain` in modals/drawers/sheets\n107\t- Page rubber-band suppression: `overscroll-behavior: none` on `<html>` inside `@media (pointer: fine)`; keep coarse-pointer page defaults for pull-to-refresh. Test hybrid touch devices: `pointer` describes the primary input, and `none` also disables scroll chaining and native swipe navigation\n108\t- During drag: disable text selection, `inert` on dragged elements\n109\t- Drag/swipe/pinch/path gestures need tap/click and keyboard alternatives unless essential\n110\t- `autoFocus` sparingly—desktop only, single primary input; avoid on mobile\n111\t\n112\t### Safe Areas & Layout\n113\t\n114\t- Full-bleed layouts need `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for notches\n115\t- Avoid unwanted scrollbars: `overflow-x-hidden` on containers, fix content overflow\n116\t- Flex/grid over JS measurement for layout\n117\t\n118\t### Dark Mode & Theming\n119\t\n120\t- `color-scheme: dark` on `<html>` for dark themes (fixes scrollbar, inputs)\n121\t- `<meta name=\"theme-color\">` matches page background\n122\t- Native `<select>`: explicit `background-color` and `color` (Windows dark mode)\n123\t\n124\t### Locale & i18n\n125\t\n126\t- Dates/times: use `Intl.DateTimeFormat` not hardcoded formats\n127\t- Numbers/currency: use `Intl.NumberFormat` not hardcoded formats\n128\t- Detect language via `Accept-Language` / `navigator.languages`, not IP\n129\t- Brand names, code tokens, identifiers: wrap with `translate=\"no\"` to prevent garbled auto-translation\n130\t\n131\t### Hydration Safety\n132\t\n133\t- Inputs with `value` need `onChange` (or use `defaultValue` for uncontrolled)\n134\t- Date/time rendering: guard against hydration mismatch (server vs client)\n135\t- `suppressHydrationWarning` only where truly needed\n136\t\n137\t### Hover & Interactive States\n138\t\n139\t- Buttons/links need `hover:` state (visual feedback)\n140\t- Interactive states increase contrast: hover/active/focus more prominent than rest\n141\t\n142\t### Content & Copy\n143\t\n144\t- Active voice: \"Install the CLI\" not \"The CLI will be installed\"\n145\t- Title Case for headings/buttons (Chicago style)\n146\t- Numerals for counts: \"8 deployments\" not \"eight\"\n147\t- Specific button labels: \"Save API Key\" not \"Continue\"\n148\t- Error messages include fix/next step, not just problem\n149\t- Second person; avoid first person\n150\t- `&` over \"and\" where space-constrained\n151\t\n152\t### Anti-patterns (flag these)\n153\t\n154\t- `user-scalable=no` or `maximum-scale=1` disabling zoom\n155\t- `onPaste` with `preventDefault`\n156\t- `transition: all`\n157\t- `outline-none` without focus-visible replacement\n158\t- Inline `onClick` navigation without `<a>`\n159\t- `<div>` or `<span>` with click handlers (should be `<button>`)\n160\t- Images without dimensions\n161\t- Large arrays `.map()` without virtualization\n162\t- Form inputs without labels\n163\t- Icon buttons without `aria-label`\n164\t- Hardcoded date/number formats (use `Intl.*`)\n165\t- `autoFocus` without clear justification\n166\t- Animated GIF when compressed video is suitable\n167\t- Gesture-only action without tap/click and keyboard alternative\n168\t\n169\t## Output Format\n170\t\n171\tGroup by file. Use `file:line` format (VS Code clickable). Terse findings.\n172\t\n173\t```text\n174\t## src/Button.tsx\n175\t\n176\tsrc/Button.tsx:42 - icon button missing aria-label\n177\tsrc/Button.tsx:18 - input lacks label\n178\tsrc/Button.tsx:55 - animation missing prefers-reduced-motion\n179\tsrc/Button.tsx:67 - transition: all → list properties\n180\t\n181\t## src/Modal.tsx\n182\t\n183\tsrc/Modal.tsx:12 - missing overscroll-behavior: contain\n184\tsrc/Modal.tsx:34 - \"...\" → \"…\"\n185\t\n186\t## src/Card.tsx\n187\t\n188\t✓ pass\n189\t```\n190\t\n191\tState issue + location. Skip explanation unless fix non-obvious. No preamble.\n192\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"aaefbd65-360d-4d4a-8ef1-61bfb0f6e2d2","uuid":"5d677544-4c1f-419f-a543-3d2563203ebd","timestamp":"2026-11-01T11:55:28.434Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"<RUN_DIR>/project/.claude/skills/web-design-guidelines/references/web-interface-guidelines.md","content":"---\ndescription: Review UI code for Vercel Web Interface Guidelines compliance\nargument-hint: <file-or-pattern>\n---\n\n# Web Interface Guidelines\n\nReview these files for compliance: $ARGUMENTS\n\nRead files, check against rules below. Output concise but comprehensive—sacrifice grammar for brevity. High signal-to-noise.\n\n## Rules\n\n### Accessibility\n\n- Icon-only buttons need `aria-label`\n- Form controls need `<label>` or `aria-label`\n- Interactive elements need keyboard handlers (`onKeyDown`/`onKeyUp`)\n- `<button>` for actions, `<a>`/`<Link>` for navigation (not `<div onClick>`)\n- Images need `alt` (or `alt=\"\"` if decorative)\n- Decorative icons need `aria-hidden=\"true\"`\n- Async updates (toasts, validation) need `aria-live=\"polite\"`\n- Use semantic HTML (`<button>`, `<a>`, `<label>`, `<table>`) before ARIA\n- Headings hierarchical `<h1>`–`<h6>`; include skip link for main content\n- `scroll-margin-top` on heading anchors\n- Meaningful media needs captions, transcripts, or descriptions as applicable\n- Media controls need keyboard support; decorative media needs assistive-tech hiding\n\n### Focus States\n\n- Interactive elements need visible focus: `focus-visible:ring-*` or equivalent\n- Never `outline-none` / `outline: none` without focus replacement\n- Use `:focus-visible` over `:focus` (avoid focus ring on click)\n- Group focus with `:focus-within` for compound controls\n- Sticky headers/footers/overlays must not cover the focused element\n\n### Forms\n\n- Inputs need `autocomplete` and meaningful `name`\n- Use correct `type` (`email`, `tel`, `url`, `number`) and `inputmode`\n- Never block paste (`onPaste` + `preventDefault`)\n- Labels clickable (`htmlFor` or wrapping control)\n- Disable spellcheck on emails, codes, usernames (`spellCheck={false}`)\n- Checkboxes/radios: label + control share single hit target (no dead zones)\n- Submit button stays enabled until request starts; spinner during request\n- Errors inline next to fields; focus first error on submit\n- Placeholders end with `…` and show example pattern\n- `autocomplete=\"off\"` on non-auth fields to avoid password manager triggers\n- Warn before navigation with unsaved changes (`beforeunload` or router guard)\n\n### Animation\n\n- Honor `prefers-reduced-motion` (provide reduced variant or disable)\n- Animate `transform`/`opacity` only (compositor-friendly)\n- Never `transition: all`—list properties explicitly\n- Set correct `transform-origin`\n- SVG: transforms on `<g>` wrapper with `transform-box: fill-box; transform-origin: center`\n- Animations interruptible—respond to user input mid-animation\n- Autoplay motion >5 seconds alongside other content needs pause, stop, or hide controls\n- Muted decorative loops must stop under `prefers-reduced-motion`\n\n### Typography\n\n- `…` not `...`\n- Curly quotes `“` `”` not straight `\"`\n- Non-breaking spaces: `10&nbsp;MB`, `⌘&nbsp;K`, brand names\n- Loading states end with `…`: `\"Loading…\"`, `\"Saving…\"`\n- `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums` for number columns/comparisons\n- Use `text-wrap: balance` or `text-pretty` on headings (prevents widows)\n\n### Content Handling\n\n- Text containers handle long content: `truncate`, `line-clamp-*`, or `break-words`\n- Flex children need `min-w-0` to allow text truncation\n- Handle empty states—don't render broken UI for empty strings/arrays\n- User-generated content: anticipate short, average, and very long inputs\n\n### Images\n\n- `<img>` needs explicit `width` and `height` (prevents CLS)\n- Below-fold images: `loading=\"lazy\"`\n- Above-fold critical images: `priority` or `fetchpriority=\"high\"`\n\n### Performance\n\n- Large lists (>50 items): virtualize (`virtua`, `content-visibility: auto`)\n- No layout reads in render (`getBoundingClientRect`, `offsetHeight`, `offsetWidth`, `scrollTop`)\n- Batch DOM reads/writes; avoid interleaving\n- Prefer uncontrolled inputs; controlled inputs must be cheap per keystroke\n- Add `<link rel=\"preconnect\">` for CDN/asset domains\n- Critical fonts: `<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"font\">` with `font-display: swap`\n- Prefer `<video autoplay muted loop playsinline>` over animated GIF; provide a still alternative\n- Short non-essential loops: Safari H.264 MP4 `<picture>` source, `prefers-reduced-motion` media condition, and still fallback\n\n### Navigation & State\n\n- URL reflects state—filters, tabs, pagination, expanded panels in query params\n- Links use `<a>`/`<Link>` (Cmd/Ctrl+click, middle-click support)\n- Deep-link all stateful UI (if uses `useState`, consider URL sync via nuqs or similar)\n- Destructive actions need confirmation modal or undo window—never immediate\n\n### Touch & Interaction\n\n- `touch-action: manipulation` (prevents double-tap zoom delay)\n- `-webkit-tap-highlight-color` set intentionally\n- `overscroll-behavior: contain` in modals/drawers/sheets\n- Page rubber-band suppression: `overscroll-behavior: none` on `<html>` inside `@media (pointer: fine)`; keep coarse-pointer page defaults for pull-to-refresh. Test hybrid touch devices: `pointer` describes the primary input, and `none` also disables scroll chaining and native swipe navigation\n- During drag: disable text selection, `inert` on dragged elements\n- Drag/swipe/pinch/path gestures need tap/click and keyboard alternatives unless essential\n- `autoFocus` sparingly—desktop only, single primary input; avoid on mobile\n\n### Safe Areas & Layout\n\n- Full-bleed layouts need `env(safe-area-inset-*)` for notches\n- Avoid unwanted scrollbars: `overflow-x-hidden` on containers, fix content overflow\n- Flex/grid over JS measurement for layout\n\n### Dark Mode & Theming\n\n- `color-scheme: dark` on `<html>` for dark themes (fixes scrollbar, inputs)\n- `<meta name=\"theme-color\">` matches page background\n- Native `<select>`: explicit `background-color` and `color` (Windows dark mode)\n\n### Locale & i18n\n\n- Dates/times: use `Intl.DateTimeFormat` not hardcoded formats\n- Numbers/currency: use `Intl.NumberFormat` not hardcoded formats\n- Detect language via `Accept-Language` / `navigator.languages`, not IP\n- Brand names, code tokens, identifiers: wrap with `translate=\"no\"` to prevent garbled auto-translation\n\n### Hydration Safety\n\n- Inputs with `value` need `onChange` (or use `defaultValue` for uncontrolled)\n- Date/time rendering: guard against hydration mismatch (server vs client)\n- `suppressHydrationWarning` only where truly needed\n\n### Hover & Interactive States\n\n- Buttons/links need `hover:` state (visual feedback)\n- Interactive states increase contrast: hover/active/focus more prominent than rest\n\n### Content & Copy\n\n- Active voice: \"Install the CLI\" not \"The CLI will be installed\"\n- Title Case for headings/buttons (Chicago style)\n- Numerals for counts: \"8 deployments\" not \"eight\"\n- Specific button labels: \"Save API Key\" not \"Continue\"\n- Error messages include fix/next step, not just problem\n- Second person; avoid first person\n- `&` over \"and\" where space-constrained\n\n### Anti-patterns (flag these)\n\n- `user-scalable=no` or `maximum-scale=1` disabling zoom\n- `onPaste` with `preventDefault`\n- `transition: all`\n- `outline-none` without focus-visible replacement\n- Inline `onClick` navigation without `<a>`\n- `<div>` or `<span>` with click handlers (should be `<button>`)\n- Images without dimensions\n- Large arrays `.map()` without virtualization\n- Form inputs without labels\n- Icon buttons without `aria-label`\n- Hardcoded date/number formats (use `Intl.*`)\n- `autoFocus` without clear justification\n- Animated GIF when compressed video is suitable\n- Gesture-only action without tap/click and keyboard alternative\n\n## Output Format\n\nGroup by file. Use `file:line` format (VS Code clickable). Terse findings.\n\n```text\n## src/Button.tsx\n\nsrc/Button.tsx:42 - icon button missing aria-label\nsrc/Button.tsx:18 - input lacks label\nsrc/Button.tsx:55 - animation missing prefers-reduced-motion\nsrc/Button.tsx:67 - transition: all → list properties\n\n## src/Modal.tsx\n\nsrc/Modal.tsx:12 - missing overscroll-behavior: contain\nsrc/Modal.tsx:34 - \"...\" → \"…\"\n\n## src/Card.tsx\n\n✓ pass\n```\n\nState issue + location. Skip explanation unless fix non-obvious. No preamble.\n","numLines":192,"startLine":1,"totalLines":192}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"call_1052344","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"rule"}}]}
